# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# POV PIPELINE - NOTIFICATIONS (Telegram)
#
#   cp notify.env.template notify.env      # notify.env is gitignored
#
# Two ways to configure:
#   1. Replace the placeholders below with real values in notify.env.
#   2. Leave the placeholders and export TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN /
#      TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID in the environment (the VPS pattern). A
#      {{PLACEHOLDER}} is resolved from the env var of the same name.
#
# Unresolved placeholders mean "notifications are off": every event is still
# written to state/pipeline.log and no stage ever fails because of it.
#
# Getting the values:
#   BOT TOKEN - talk to @BotFather, /newbot, copy the token.
#   CHAT ID   - message your bot once, then open
#               https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates
#               and read result[0].message.chat.id
#
# NEVER COMMIT REAL VALUES.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN={{TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN}}
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID={{TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID}}

# Test it:
#   python notify.py --test
